## What you need to do after running this

**One-time setup checklist:**

| # | Action | Where |
|---|--------|--------|
| 1 | Run the full script above | `agdw19prd001\sqlprd001` → `dbadb` |
| 2 | Confirm your **Database Mail profile name** (replace `DBA Alerts` in Step 2) | `msdb.dbo.sysmail_profile` |
| 3 | Replace `dba-team@ny.state.ny.us` with your actual recipient address | Step 2 of the job |
| 4 | Open the job in SSMS → **Step 1** → change **"Run on"** to your `09-Production` CMS server group | SSMS Job Properties |
| 5 | Ensure all production servers have a **linked server** entry back to `agdw19prd001\sqlprd001` (so Step 1 can INSERT into the staging table) | Each target server |
| 6 | Test by right-clicking the job → **Start Job at Step 1** | SSMS |

