## How it works end-to-end
```
7:00 AM every day
      │
      ▼
 Step 1 runs on EVERY server in 09-Production CMS group
      │  → Deletes its own rows from Staging_BackupReport
      │  → Queries its own msdb for backup history
      │  → Inserts results back to CMS staging table
      ▼
 Step 2 runs on CMS master only
      │  → Queries Staging_BackupReport
      │  → Flags any DB where LastFullBackup is NULL or > 24 hrs old
      │  → Builds color-coded HTML table (red rows = at risk)
      │  → Emails subject line: ✅ All Healthy OR ⚠️ X DB(s) at risk
      ▼
 Your inbox
